<title>USA: Nobel Insurance held by Seattle firm.</title>
<headline>Nobel Insurance held by Seattle firm.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>TSI Management Inc, a Seattle, Wash.,-based investment firm, said Friday it holds a 5.49 percent stake, or 252,642 common shares, in Nobel Insurance Ltd.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, TSI said it paid $2.89 million for the stake and holds it for investment purposes.</p>
<p>It said it bought the stake between June 25 and December 9 at prices ranging from $11.00 to $12.375 a share.</p>
<p>Nobel Insurance is based in Dallas.</p>
</text>
